  "translation": "This afternoon, I went to the library with my friend. There are many books in the library. In front of the library there is a big tree, and behind the library there is a small garden. I found a book about history, and my friend found a book about animals. We sat on chairs and read. After reading for two hours, we felt too tired and didn't want to read anymore. Then we went to the coffee shop under the library and had a cup of coffee. This cup of coffee was very good. That book was very interesting. We will come again later."
